<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 30.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 30.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing</p>
<p>rates for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     July 30     July 29   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  288.030     287.140     247.020   16.60 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  308.390     308.590     306.830    0.51 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.430     156.450     158.970   -1.60 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.410	46.388	47.182   -1.64 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  468.140     468.660     419.180   11.68 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  138.940     138.835     141.685   -1.94 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.048	16.054	16.185   -0.85 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  242.480     244.190     212.430   14.15 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.855	 1.855	 1.888   -1.75 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.550	 1.549	 1.581   -1.96 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.220     189.370     183.135    3.32 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
